      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This project will fundamentally change lives by establishing reliable access to clean water, directly addressing a critical public health crisis in these communities. Over the next decade, we anticipate seeing a profound reduction in waterborne illnesses, allowing families to dedicate time previously spent fetching water toward education and economic growth. This foundational security will empower local women, who currently shoulder the burden of water collection, to drive community development forward in a truly transformative way. We are building systems that are both sustainable and resilient, ensuring this positive change endures far beyond the initial grant period.",
      "source": "target",
